stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> new: Guest QR / online order
  [*] --> accepted: POS order by staff
  new --> accepted: Staff tap Accept
  new --> cancelled: Rejected / prank
  accepted --> preparing: KOT at station
  preparing --> ready: Chef marks ready
  ready --> served: Captain serves
  served --> paid: Cashier charges
  accepted --> cancelled: Void (manager PIN)
  preparing --> cancelled: Void (manager PIN)
  paid --> [*]
  cancelled --> [*]
  note right of paid
    Stock deducted by recipe
    Loyalty points added
    Table / party freed
    E-bill on WhatsApp
  end note
